{
 "subtitles": [
  {
   "start": 0.402,
   "end": 1.874,
   "text": "In September twenty twenty-two,"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.45,
   "end": 4.444,
   "text": "Vladimir Putin said Russia would use"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.444,
   "end": 6.558,
   "text": "all the means at its disposal,"
  },
  {
   "start": 6.558,
   "end": 7.59,
   "text": "and added:"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.59,
   "end": 8.934,
   "text": "\"It's not a bluff.\""
  },
  {
   "start": 9.257,
   "end": 10.524,
   "text": "Two weeks later,"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.524,
   "end": 12.084,
   "text": "President Biden said the world had"
  },
  {
   "start": 12.084,
   "end": 14.164,
   "text": "not faced the prospect of Armageddon"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.164,
   "end": 16.154,
   "text": "since the Cuban Missile Crisis."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.685,
   "end": 17.584,
   "text": "He added that he did"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.584,
   "end": 18.764,
   "text": "not think there was any"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.764,
   "end": 20.484,
   "text": "such thing as easily using"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.484,
   "end": 22.474,
   "text": "a tactical nuclear weapon."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.846,
   "end": 24.184,
   "text": "The White House said at"
  },
  {
   "start": 24.184,
   "end": 25.704,
   "text": "the time that it saw"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.704,
   "end": 27.714,
   "text": "no sign of imminent use."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.643,
   "end": 29.764,
   "text": "Behind the scenes,"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.764,
   "end": 31.014,
   "text": "the channels opened."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.44,
   "end": 33.544,
   "text": "American and Russian defence chiefs"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.544,
   "end": 35.514,
   "text": "spoke by phone in October."
  },
  {
   "start": 36.396,
   "end": 37.444,
   "text": "In November,"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.444,
   "end": 39.344,
   "text": "news reports said senior Russian"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.344,
   "end": 42.214,
   "text": "officials had discussed tactical use,"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.45,
   "end": 44.024,
   "text": "with no evidence that any"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.024,
   "end": 45.834,
   "text": "warhead had been moved."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.53,
   "end": 48.024,
   "text": "Days later the head of the"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.024,
   "end": 50.924,
   "text": "CIA met Russia's foreign intelligence chief"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.924,
   "end": 53.284,
   "text": "in Ankara to warn against it."
  }
